        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued September 25 at 2:26AM EDT until September 27 at 8:00PM EDT by NWS Gray ME</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...For the Small Craft Advisory, seas 2 to 5 ft. For the
Small Craft Advisory, northeast winds 15 to 25 kt with gusts
up to 35 kt and seas 6 to 9 ft expected.

* WHERE...Casco Bay.

* WHEN...For the first Small Craft Advisory, until 8 AM EDT this
morning. For the second Small Craft Advisory, from 11 AM this
morning to 8 PM EDT Sunday.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.
</description>
        <instruction>Inexperienced mariners, especially those operating smaller
vessels, should avoid navigating in hazardous conditions.</instruction>
